TI  - Phytochemicals and Irisin as Multi-Target Regulators of Adipose Tissue Browning and Metabolic Reprogramming: Synergies with GLP-1 Pathways.
AU  - Ulusu Nuriye Nuray
JO  - Antioxidants (Basel, Switzerland)
PY  - 2026
